 CellID->1893017526,ExpressionUUID->"68abc85c-a089-4aaf-9203-3f71d7d737f3"],

Cell["\<\
DiscKosky also exposes some lower-level functions that can be used to \
identify nonzero sequences of discontinuities.\
\>", "TechNoteText",
 CellID->208849413,ExpressionUUID->"b271eda9-ddd2-44b9-a5a5-2b04c834821e"],

Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
   {
